      m_Calls: []
  m_text: Each player gets the configured 1-5 drops (default three); real settled-bin
    points add across the competition. Steering chooses release position and throttle
    adjusts initial spin. Hold ACTION and steer to roll the trailer across the board,
    or throttle/brake to tilt its release angle. Release ACTION to drop; a quick
    tap also drops. You have the displayed preparation time before automatic release.
    Real peg contacts, inertia and gravity determine the bin; the trailer must settle
    supported by the catch tray. Precision Drop marks a target bin for each drop;
    Chaos moves physical pegs; High-Risk Jackpot triples the center bin. Leaving
    the board or exceeding the flight timer is a zero-point miss. Only a scored or
    failed drop resets to the ordinary starting position for the next turn. Horn
    and pause controls are unchanged.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
